    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-47",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5344,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 46,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "10 · 選取與物件變形",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-48",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5406,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 47,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "選取 · 套索多選",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-49",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5468,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 48,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "V選取，Ctrl+點擊增減物件，套索沿範圍選取。空白處拖框左往右為藍實線，只選完全包含；右往左綠虛線，選碰到的物件；Ctrl／Shift拖框追加。多選可整組移動、複製、貼上、改樣式與刪除。 物件右鍵可移至圖層頂端、上移圖層、下移圖層或移至圖層底端；支援未鎖定多選並保留相對順序，每次實際變更可用一次復原恢復。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-50",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5620,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 49,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "單一形狀有八方向縮放与旋轉把手，游標顯示相對應方向或旋轉箭頭；線段／箭頭為A、B，圓弧有起訖角。圖片角落預設等比，Shift自由縮放；旋轉Shift吸附15°。鎖定物件不參與批次移動／刪除，隱藏物件仍留在圖層。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-51",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5742,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 50,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "建立物件或單擊選取時，只顯示大小、旋轉、端點等控制點，不自動彈出詳細調整列。雙擊物件才開啟詳細屬性；雙擊文字進入文字編輯。選取工具可隨時切換回繪圖，繪圖工具不會在每一筆結束後切回 V。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-52",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5920,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 51,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "11 · 屬性、色彩與樣式",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-53",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5982,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 52,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "線條樣式 · 延伸直線",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-54",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6044,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 53,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "屬性面板只顯示所選物件適用項目，可調線色、粗細、適用的填色／漸層／透明度、文字與幾何數值。實線、虛線、點線、點劃線提供樣本，工具列顯示目前樣式；可先設繪圖偏好，修改選取物件也更新後續繪圖設定。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-55",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6166,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 54,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "按停靠或拖標題到四邊，左右直排、上下橫排。圖層、橡皮擦與尺規有各自入口，避免混入不相關物件屬性。延伸直線及箭頭頭部長寬在對應屬性中。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-56",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6314,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 55,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "12 · 文字與便條紙",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-57",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6376,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 56,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "文字 · 便條紙",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-58",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6438,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 57,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "T或便條紙工具後點畫布輸入，Enter換行，Ctrl+Enter或離開完成，Esc取消，組字不觸發工具快捷鍵。色圓提供字型、粗體、斜體、底線、刪除線及對齊；便條紙有折角、紙膠帶、貓咪、筆記本、方格及柔和款。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-59",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6560,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 58,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "編輯局部文字格式視窗中先選文字再改格式、文字色或標記色，保存為一筆Undo。文字或草稿右鍵可調整整框樣式；更多文字設定只套用修改欄位到本頁未鎖定文字／便條紙，略過其他物件。螢幕文字支援8–144 pt、自訂#RRGGBB、字型、對齊與透明度。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-60",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6738,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 59,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "13 · 橡皮擦",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-61",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 60,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "橡皮擦",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-62",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6862,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 61,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "選橡皮擦，再點目前工具開設定，選物件擦除／局部筆跡擦除及直徑；一般與螢幕畫布均以半透明圓顯示範圍。 右下板擦與藤條皆為45°，依實際圖形底邊對齊、可見大小相近；板擦仍按住拖曳，藤條仍點一下選用。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-63",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6984,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 62,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "物件擦除整筆移除碰到的筆畫或幾何；局部擦除只移除劃過的筆跡段。文字、便條紙及圖片受到保護，刪除請選取後按Delete。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-64",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7076,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 63,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "一般畫布右下角有原創紙白／霧綠俯視磁吸板擦，按住拖曳依斜放的圓角擦面輪廓擦除，放開回到停靠處並提交一筆可復原操作；Esc 或失去捕捉會取消整次擦拭。右鍵板擦選物件或局部筆跡模式，也可隱藏；首頁設定→顯示板擦可重新開啟。擦面以畫面大小顯示，隨縮放換算到作品座標。局部／像素模式只切斷筆跡，不修改圖片像素或原始 PDF／簡報元素；螢幕畫布仍使用工具列的圓形橡皮擦。工具列「更多→顯示板擦」可隨時切換顯示並記住選擇；板擦呈左高右低，抓取與擦除輪廓同步鏡像。 圓形橡皮擦可連續拖曳；擦除預覽逐步更新，放開滑鼠完成本次擦除並合成一筆復原操作。Esc或指標捕捉中斷會取消尚未完成的擦除。正常儲存或退出會等待已放開的擦除完成。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
